sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Middleware
    participant NextJs as Next.js Server
    participant After as After Function
    participant DB as Database
    participant External as External Service

    Client->>Middleware: 1. Send HTTP Request

    Note over Middleware: 2. Process request<br/>(e.g., auth, logging)

    Middleware->>NextJs: 3. Pass (modified) request

    NextJs->>DB: 4. Fetch data (if needed)
    DB-->>NextJs: 5. Return data

    Note over NextJs: 6. Generate response

    NextJs-->>Middleware: 7. Send response
    Middleware-->>Client: 8. Forward response

    Note over Client: 9. Client receives response

